      </table>
      <div class="phase-note" style="margin-top:12px;"><strong>What just happened:</strong> Rental Revenue, Service Revenue, every expense account, and Dividends all reset to zero. Retained Earnings now carries ${fmt(endRE)} forward into next period's Beginning Retained Earnings.</div>

      <div class="phase-note" style="margin-top:16px;background:#fff3e0;border-left-color:var(--orange);"><strong>Check your understanding:</strong> What happens to the books when the temporary accounts (revenue, expense, and dividends) are closed at the end of the period?</div>
      <div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Closing entries comprehension question" id="p5-mc-group" style="margin:12px 0;">
        ${buildP5MCOptions()}
      </div>
      <div style="text-align:center;"><button class="fs-submit-btn" id="p5-mc-submit" onclick="checkP5MC()" disabled>Check Answer</button></div>
      <div class="je-feedback" id="p5-mc-feedback" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div>

